<title>GERMANY: ATHLETICS-STUTTGART INTERNATIONAL MEETING RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-STUTTGART INTERNATIONAL MEETING RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
